    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Email Calendar Assistant\nTriggered by an unread email whose subject matches \"Re: Your Morning Calendar Brief\" (i.e. you replying to the morning brief).\nReply \"tomorrow\" -> emails back tomorrow's agenda across all 3 accounts.\nReply \"week\" -> emails back the next 7 days across all 3 accounts.\nReply \"add: <event>\" -> parses it and creates a Google Calendar event on your Dynamack calendar, then confirms by email.\nAnything else -> gets a help reply.\nEach run marks the triggering email read so it is not reprocessed on the next poll.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 300
      },
